A DLL mod that lets you teleport straight to another player in your Seamless Co-op session, right next to them instead of to a grace. Fully configurable via its config file.

[size=4][b]Why this mod?[/b][/size]
[i]Have you ever been out exploring with your friends, only to get ambushed and killed - and then had to make the long trek from the last grace all the way back to them, while they stood around waiting for you?

Yeah, me too. More times than I'd like to admit.

So I made this mod. Now when that happens, I just open the menu, pick my friend, and I'm right back at their side - no running, no "wait, where are you?", no one left waiting. Just back to the adventure.[/i]

[size=4][b]Requirements[/b][/size]
[list]
[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/eldenring/mods/510]Seamless Co-op[/url].[/*]
[*]Every player you want to teleport to must have this mod installed too.[/*]
[/list]

[b][color=#E74C3C]Only use in offline mode with EAC disabled![/color][/b]

[size=4][b]Usage[/b][/size]
[list=1]
[*]Join a Seamless Co-op session.[/*]
[*]Press [b]Tab[/b] to open the menu (change it with [b]MenuKey[/b] in [b]SoulsTeleport.ini[/b]).[/*]
[*]Click the player you want to teleport to.[/*]
[/list]

[size=4][b]Installation[/b][/size]

Any DLL mod loader works, e.g. [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/eldenring/mods/117]Elden Mod Loader[/url], [url=https://github.com/soulsmods/ModEngine2/releases]Mod Engine 2[/url], [url=https://github.com/garyttierney/me3/releases]Mod Engine 3[/url].

[b]Option 1 - [url=https://github.com/soulsmods/ModEngine2/releases]Mod Engine 2[/url] (recommended)[/b]
[list=1]
[*]Download Mod Engine 2 from the link above and extract it into your game folder (the same folder as [i]eldenring.exe[/i]).[/*]
[*]Download this mod, then create a folder to hold it and its INI file - for example, inside your game folder create a [b]natives[/b] folder.[/*]
[*]Open [b]config_eldenring.toml[/b] and edit [b]external_dlls = [ ][/b] to add the DLL, e.g.:
[code]external_dlls = [
    "natives\\SoulsTeleport.dll",
][/code]
[/*]
[*]Launch the game using Mod Engine 2's launcher, [b]modengine2_launcher.exe[/b].[/*]
[/list]

[b]Option 2 - [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/eldenring/mods/117]Elden Mod Loader[/url][/b]
[list=1]
[*]Download Elden Mod Loader from the link above and extract it into your game folder.[/*]
[*]Download this mod and drag [b]SoulsTeleport.dll[/b] and [b]SoulsTeleport.ini[/b] into the [b]mods[/b] folder.[/*]
[*]Launch the game - the mod will be loaded automatically.[/*]
[/list]

